  "details": "# Expectation\n\nI expected to see who I blocked when I clicked on the \"Blocked\" list in the \"Social\" menu.\n\n# Reality\n\nWhen switching from one list to the \"Blocked\" list, such as \"All Friends\" or any favorite friends list, players from the previous list appeared in the \"Blocked\" list, despite not being blocked.\n\n# Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the \"Social\" menu.\n\n2. Navigate to \"All Friends\" or any favorite friends list.\n\n3. Navigate to the \"Blocked\" list.\n\n# Additional details\n\nI only tested this on the Quest, but other platforms could be affected as well.",
